title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf watch check
catalog: CLI command
target: mf watch check
summary: Report whether the watcher records a change at each path

!! Reference

```
Report whether the watcher records a change at each path

Usage: mf watch check [OPTIONS] [PATHS]...

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...
          Absolute filesystem paths (an existing path is canonicalised and made repo-root-relative; a leading-slash path that is gone from disk is taken as repo-root-relative — an orphan's stale path)

Options:
      --json
          Print the raw JSON response body

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
